Package: syinexplore
Title: Explore Baltimore Trash Wheel Collections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Siyuan", "Yin",
        email = "syin0014@student.monash.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides prepared data and an interactive Shiny app for
    exploring rubbish collected by Baltimore's Trash Wheel family.
    Users can select collection sites and years to compare estimated
    item counts per recorded collection. Includes a summary function
    and documentation explaining the data and its limitations.
